    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec927b91ebc4926d06f30fd7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "黄金城市很遗憾地败给了玉藻十字。\n对于玉藻十字的实力，\n观众席上满是赞美之词。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b217ab95f66c5900c40437fc6c8fc38fefbe4a872de9a9f1f4908845cb8414de",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1040/storytimeline_501040426.json",
      "json_path": [
