      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "黄金城市在羡慕的同时也感到失望。\n完全没人提到她至今的成绩。\n令她不禁想着，无论怎么跑都无法受到肯定──",
      "source_fingerprint": "4105acb9398f3c3f6ab5e3442ddb2ec160ba7d75bdc4a43c0ea1bbd0acbab0b9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
