      "uid": "zhcn:2b4485b6ec983665d9887696",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "赛后，经纪人告诉黄金城市\n现在的她并不美，只是个空壳子。\n并建议她放弃跑步。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e17e91500e2d8ab9aedb909a81bd6d189891cc500e15b090257e8fc8cd4f785d",
